{
"#name"
:
{
"keyring"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"加密本地 note — 把要复用的密钥 / 凭证 / 关键信息存到 OS 加密库,系统级保护,跨 session 取用"
,
"en"
:
"Encrypted local note — persist reusable keys / credentials / critical info into the OS-encrypted store, OS-level protection, retrieve across sessions"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x keyring set [--ns <name>] <service> [<password>]"
,
"x keyring get [--ns <name>] <service>"
,
"x keyring get_ [--ns <name>] <service>"
,
"x keyring ls [--ns <name>] [-a] [<service>]"
,
"x keyring rm [--ns <name>] <service>"
,
"x keyring cset|cget|cls|crm [--ns <name>] <service> (macOS iCloud Keychain)"
,
"x keyring cget_ [--ns <name>] <service> (macOS iCloud Keychain; sentinel-padded)"
,
"x keyring lock"
,
"x keyring unlock"
,
"x keyring backend ls|get|set"
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"系统级加密的本地 note:把密钥 / 凭证 / 关键信息(API token / SSH 私钥 / DB 密码 / TLS 证书 / 服务账号 / 任何不想明文落盘的敏感数据)存入 OS 原生加密凭证库(macOS Keychain / Linux SecretService / KWallet / Windows Credential Manager),受系统级安全保护,本机落盘加密。跨 shell、跨 session 取用,不进 .env / 不进 shell history。每条目 namespace 默认 x-cmd-<UID>。要每访问鉴权 / 网络授权 / 跨设备同步,走 op/bw/vault。"
,
"en"
:
"System-level encrypted local note: persist keys / credentials / critical info (API tokens / SSH private keys / DB passwords / TLS certs / service accounts / any sensitive data you don't want plaintext) into the OS-native encrypted credential store (macOS Keychain / Linux SecretService / KWallet / Windows Credential Manager), protected by OS-level security, at-rest encryption on the local machine. Accessible across shells and sessions without .env files or shell history. Namespace defaults to x-cmd-<UID>. For per-access auth / network approval / cross-device sync, use op/bw/vault."
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring set github alice"
,
"cn"
:
"落盘:把 token / 私钥 / 关键信息存进 OS keychain 的 (github, alice) 条目里"
,
"en"
:
"Persist: write the token / private key / critical info to keychain entry (github, alice)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring get github alice"
,
"cn"
:
"取用:$(x keyring get github alice) 在脚本里直接拿到密码"
,
"en"
:
"Retrieve: $(x keyring get github alice) inside a script reads the secret directly"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"printf '%s' \"$pw\" | x keyring set github alice"
,
"cn"
:
"脚本用法:从 stdin 喂密码到 keychain,不在 shell history 留痕"
,
"en"
:
"Scripted: pipe password via stdin to avoid leaving plaintext in shell history"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring ls"
,
"cn"
:
"审计:看自己落盘了哪些条目"
,
"en"
:
"Audit: list what entries I have stored"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring lock"
,
"cn"
:
"备用:macOS 真锁 keychain;Linux / Windows 是 daemon-managed,no-op + 提示"
,
"en"
:
"Optional: macOS real keychain lock; Linux / Windows are daemon-managed, no-op + note"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring cset github alice"
,
"cn"
:
"iCloud Keychain(macOS):跟 `set` 一样,但同步到 Apple 设备"
,
"en"
:
"iCloud Keychain (macOS): same as `set` but synced to Apple devices"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring backend set secret_service"
,
"cn"
:
"后端切换:Linux 下用 SecretService / KWallet,macOS 下用 Keychain"
,
"en"
:
"Backend switch: Linux SecretService / KWallet, macOS Keychain"
}
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"使用范围:本机 + 系统级加密 + 落盘 = 小型加密 note。合适:任何你不想明文存的东西 — API token / SSH 私钥 / DB 密码 / recovery code / TLS 客户端证书 / 服务账号。不合适:每访问鉴权 / 网络授权(`op/bw/vault`)/跨设备同步(iCloud Keychain 走 `cget/cset/cls`,或换工具)。"
,
"en"
:
"Use scope: local + OS-level encryption + at-rest = small encrypted note. Fits: anything you don't want plaintext — API tokens / SSH private keys / DB passwords / recovery codes / TLS client certs / service accounts. Doesn't fit: per-access auth / network approval (`op/bw/vault`) / cross-device sync (iCloud Keychain via `cget/cset/cls`, or a different tool)."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"UID 命名空间:`--ns` 默认 x-cmd-<UID>。同一 UID 多个脚本写同一个 service 会覆盖(后写赢)。多脚本独立,各自分 `--ns deploy-bot` / `--ns ci-runner`。"
,
"en"
:
"UID namespace: `--ns` defaults to x-cmd-<UID>. Same-UID scripts overwrite each other (last write wins). For independent slots, give each `--ns` (e.g. `--ns deploy-bot`, `--ns ci-runner`)."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"`set` 密码输入:推荐 `printf '%s' \"$pw\" | x keyring set ...`(不要 `echo`,带尾换行),或 tty 静默提示。空密码拒。"
,
"en"
:
"`set` input: pipe `printf '%s' \"$pw\" | x keyring set ...` (avoid `echo`, trailing newline); or tty silent prompt. Empty password rejected."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"同 UID 脚本能 dump 你所有条目:macOS `security find-generic-password -w` / Linux `secret-tool search` + DBus / Windows `CredEnumerate`。x keyring 不挡这层 —— OS 三都这模型。关键条目别放 OS keychain,真·高敏走 op/bw/vault。"
,
"en"
:
"Same-UID scripts can dump all your entries: macOS `security find-generic-password -w`, Linux `secret-tool search` + DBus, Windows `CredEnumerate`. x keyring does not block this — OS model is the same on all three. Keep critical entries out of OS keychain; use op/bw/vault for truly sensitive."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"`lock` / `unlock` 仅 macOS 真锁;其它 OS 由 daemon / login session 管理,无 CLI 接口。**核心流程是落盘加密,lock/unlock 是备用**。"
,
"en"
:
"`lock` / `unlock` is macOS-only; other OS is daemon-managed, no CLI. **Core flow is at-rest encryption; lock/unlock is optional.**"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:credential"
:
[
"get"
,
"get_"
,
"set"
,
"ls"
,
"rm"
]
,
"#subcmd:icloud"
:
[
"cget"
,
"cget_"
,
"cset"
,
"cls"
,
"crm"
]
,
"#subcmd:security"
:
[
"lock"
,
"unlock"
]
,
"#subcmd:backend"
:
[
"backend"
]
,
"get"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"从 keychain 取已落盘的密码"
,
"en"
:
"Retrieve an already-stored password from the keychain"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x keyring get [--ns <name>] <service>"
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring get --ns alice github"
,
"cn"
:
"namespace 默认 x-cmd-<UID>;用 --ns 看其他 namespace 的条目"
,
"en"
:
"namespace defaults to x-cmd-<UID>; use --ns to read another namespace's entry"
}
]
,
"--ns|--namespace"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"namespace 名(默认 x-cmd-<UID>)"
,
"en"
:
"namespace name (default x-cmd-<UID>)"
}
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"service 名"
,
"en"
:
"service name"
}
}
}
,
"get_"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"get 的脚本变体 — 写到变量,适合在脚本里 round-trip 不丢尾字节"
,
"en"
:
"script-friendly get — writes to a variable; for byte-exact round-trip inside scripts"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x keyring get_ [--ns <name>] <service>"
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"与 `get` 的差异:密码放进 shell 变量,不直接打印 —— 脚本里没有 `$()` 加尾 \\n 的副作用,适合需要原样存回 / 二次处理的场景。"
,
"en"
:
"Difference from `get`: writes to a shell variable instead of stdout — no trailing-newline side-effect from `$()`, useful when the value must round-trip byte-exact or be reprocessed."
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring get_ github"
,
"cn"
:
"把密码放进当前 shell 的 $x_,脚本可接着处理"
,
"en"
:
"Capture password into $x_ in the current shell for further processing"
}
]
,
"--ns|--namespace"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"namespace 名(默认 x-cmd-<UID>)"
,
"en"
:
"namespace name (default x-cmd-<UID>)"
}
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"service 名"
,
"en"
:
"service name"
}
}
}
,
"set"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"把密码写到 keychain:namespace 默认 x-cmd-<UID>。管道喂密码(或 tty 静默提示)"
,
"en"
:
"Write a password to the keychain; namespace defaults to x-cmd-<UID>. Pipe the password via stdin (or tty silent prompt)"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x keyring set [--ns <name>] <service> [<password>]"
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"位置参数顺序:service 在前,可选 password 在后。namespace 不再是位置参数 —— 走 `--ns`。"
,
"en"
:
"Positional order: service first, optional password second. The namespace is no longer positional — it goes through `--ns`."
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
