"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列条目(默认只看当前 UID 自己的);输出 service<TAB>namespace"
,
"en"
:
"List entries (current UID by default); output is service<TAB>namespace"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x keyring ls [--ns <name>] [-a] [<service>]"
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"backend 决定枚举能力:keychain 走 `security dump-keychain` awk 解析 (真实列出所有 genp);KWallet 走 `kwalletcli5 -l`;SecretService 没全局 list,只能 `secret-tool search service <svc>`。Linux 下 `-a`(列所有 namespace)经常空,正常。"
,
"en"
:
"Backend determines enumeration: keychain parses `security dump-keychain` (real genp list); KWallet uses `kwalletcli5 -l`; SecretService has no global list — only `secret-tool search service <svc>`. On Linux, `-a` (list all namespaces) often returns empty; that's by design."
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring ls"
,
"cn"
:
"列当前 UID 自己的条目"
,
"en"
:
"List current UID's entries"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring ls github"
,
"cn"
:
"只列 service=github 的条目"
,
"en"
:
"Filter by service"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring ls --ns alice"
,
"cn"
:
"看指定 namespace 下的条目"
,
"en"
:
"Show entries under a specific namespace"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring ls -a"
,
"cn"
:
"列所有 namespace(绕过 UID 隔离)"
,
"en"
:
"List every namespace (escape UID isolation)"
}
]
,
"--ns|--namespace"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"namespace 名(默认 x-cmd-<UID>)"
,
"en"
:
"namespace name (default x-cmd-<UID>)"
}
}
,
"-a|--all"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列所有 namespace(绕过 UID 隔离)"
,
"en"
:
"List every namespace (escape UID isolation)"
}
}
,
