"lock"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"备用,macOS 真锁;其它 OS no-op + 提示"
,
"en"
:
"Optional, macOS real lock; other OS no-op + note"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x keyring lock"
,
"x keyring lock --screen"
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring lock"
,
"cn"
:
"macOS 真锁;Linux / Windows 是 daemon-managed,no-op + 提示"
,
"en"
:
"macOS real; Linux / Windows are daemon-managed, no-op + note"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring lock --screen"
,
"cn"
:
"Windows 锁屏(macOS / Linux 用 OS 自己的:Cmd-Ctrl-Q / Super-L)"
,
"en"
:
"Windows screen lock (macOS / Linux use OS-native Cmd-Ctrl-Q / Super-L)"
}
]
}
,
"unlock"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"备用,macOS 真解锁;其它 OS no-op + 提示(daemon-managed)"
,
"en"
:
"Optional, macOS real unlock; other OS no-op + note (daemon-managed)"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x keyring unlock"
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"macOS-only:其它 OS 由 daemon / login session 管理,无 CLI unlock。Linux secret_service / kwallet 自动在 user login 时 unlock;Windows CM 在 user logon 时 unlock。要强制重新解锁,登出再登入。"
,
"en"
:
"macOS-only: other OS keychains are unlocked by daemon / login session; no CLI unlock. Linux secret_service / kwallet auto-unlock on user login; Windows CM auto-unlocks on user logon. To force re-unlock, logoff and back in."
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring unlock"
,
"cn"
:
"macOS 提示输密码;其它 OS no-op + 提示"
,
"en"
:
"macOS prompts for password; other OS no-op + note"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x keyring unlock <<<\"$KEYCHAIN_PW\""
,
"cn"
:
"macOS 脚本里 pipe 一次密码解锁"
,
"en"
:
"macOS script: pipe password once to unlock"
}
]
}
,
