"cls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"iCloud Keychain 列(macOS-only)"
,
"en"
:
"iCloud Keychain list (macOS-only)"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"解析 `security dump-keychain` 输出(默认搜索列表包含 iCloud),跟 `ls` 一样过滤。当前 namespace 默认;`-a` 列全部。"
,
"en"
:
